'lascombes|2022':{blend:{CS:60,ME:37,PV:3},harvest:'7 septembre',yld:36,note:'Hand harvesting in several passes, according to the level of maturity of the plots.',taste:'s quotidiennes. Gentle vinification by infusion. Cold maceration. Maceration period from 30 to 35 days decided by daily tastings. 14% vol. 36 hl/ha En barriques et foudres. In barrels and casks. Chevalier de Lascombes SECOND VIN — MARGAUX 2O22',url:'https://chateau-lascombes.com/en/chateau-lascombes-2022/',src:'Chevalier_FT_2022.pdf'},
'lascombes|2023':{blend:{ME:70,CS:27,PV:3},harvest:'24 septembre',yld:35,alc:13.5,note:'Hand harvesting in several passes, according to the level of maturity of the plots.',taste:'s quotidiennes. Gentle vinification by infusion. Maceration period from 25 to 30 days decided by daily tastings. DEGRÉ ALCOOLIQUE / ALCOHOL CONTENT 14% vol. RENDEMENT / YIELD 35 hl/',src:'FT-La-Cote-Lascombes-2023.pdf'},
'lascombes|2024':{blend:{CS:65,ME:30,CF:5},yld:38,note:'Hand harvesting in several passes, according to the level of maturity of the plots.',taste:'s quotidiennes. Gentle vinification by infusion. Maceration period from 20 to 30 days decided by daily tastings. 13% vol. 38 hl/ha En barriques, foudres et amphores. In barrels, casks and amphoras. Chevalier de Lascombes SECOND VIN — MARGAUX 2O24',url:'https://chateau-lascombes.com/millesime-2024/',src:'FT-Chevalier-Lascombes-2024_OK.pdf'},
'lascombes|2025':{blend:{CS:60,ME:35,CF:5},harvest:'25 septembre',yld:25,alc:13.5,note:'Hand harvesting in several passes, according to the level of maturity of the plots.',taste:'Combining density and elegance, the 2025 vintage asserts a classic, refined Bordeaux profile—gracefully powerful and unexpectedly so, given the decidedly luminous nature of the year. Château Lascombes Grand Vin – Margaux Second Grand Cru Classé en 1855 Millésime 2025',url:'https://chateau-lascombes.com/en/primeurs-2025/',src:'FT-Chevalier-Lascombes-2025.pdf'},
